    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01331",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "岛村的眼睛也湿润了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Shimamura's eyes had grown moist too.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01331",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他眨了眨眼，眸子里映满了银河。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He blinked, and the Milky Way filled his eyes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
