    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01331",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他控制住晶莹欲滴的泪珠。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He held back the bright tears that were about to fall.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01331",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“每晚都出现这样的银河吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Does the Milky Way appear like this every night?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
